## Scorecard (weighted A–F)

| Category | Weight | A | C | F |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Parse & graph fidelity | 25% | Cert 9/9; opaque cells < 1% of formulas | opaque 1–10% | cert failed / opaque > 10% |
| Baseline integrity | 20% | COM-recalc baseline; staleness measured; drift floor recorded | baseline present, staleness unmeasured | cached values used as baseline |
| Blast-radius containment | 20% | hard containment held on last 5 changes | advisory only (opaque downgrade) | escapees accepted without review |
| Regression verification | 25% | diff gate passed, error floor held | tolerance flags human-resolved | gate skipped or reverts unlogged |
| VBA coverage | 10% | all modules exported + census complete | export blocked by trust setting (documented) | macros present, unanalyzed, unmentioned |

Grade = weighted average; **any single F caps the overall grade at D**, because each
category is a load-bearing safety mechanism, not a style point.

